on editorsOnly () {
	«Call this script from a #security script when you want to ensure that only the managing editor and contributing editors have access.
	«Changes:
		«9/8/03; 4:39:28 PM by JES
			«Content Editors are also editors. This script was missed when the Content Editor was added to Manila.
		«04/10/00; 2:45:54 PM by PBS
			«Updated to handle the hashed cookies format. Also: call the new bottleneck script at manilaSuite.editors.prefsSecurity.
	
	local (adrNewsSite = responderAttributes.newsSite);
	local (editorsList = adrNewsSite^.sysopMail);
	if typeOf (editorsList) != listType {
		editorsList = {editorsList}};
	editorsList = editorsList + adrNewsSite^.contributingEditors;
	if defined (adrNewsSite^.contentEditors) {
		editorsList = editorsList + adrNewsSite^.contentEditors};
	
	return (manilaSuite.editors.prefsSecurity (editorsList))}